# Per-run outputs. The raw run_NN folders and cost_log.jsonl are tracked (about 3 MB).
# Dry runs and the two derived folders are not: backfilled_v7/ comes from
# analysis/backfill_provenance.py and rescored_v8/ from analysis/rescore_v8.py (commands in README).
results/runs/*/dry_run*/
